## Topbar
**Node ID:** 681:122

The editor shell header. Publish state and the review pill are the only things that vary — everything else is fixed by contract.

## Button
**Node ID:** 9:102

Primary is the ONE filled accent button per screen. Destructive is red because red means error/danger/destructive in this product and nothing else — never a CTA. Focus is a 2px OUTSIDE accent ring, keyboard-only, and must stay visually distinct from hover. Every disabled variant ships a tooltip naming the role needed: disabled without a reason is a bug.

## Save status
**Node ID:** 697:461

Autosave has five truths and the design only ever drew one. Conflict and offline are the two the user must not miss — their work is not where they think it is.

## Presence
**Node ID:** 692:472

Who else is in the file. Solo renders nothing. Overflow past three. The connection pill is the only way a user learns their edits are not landing.

## Icon button
**Node ID:** 697:440

32×32 so it clears the 24px touch minimum. Focus draws an outside ring — a keyboard user must be able to see where they are.

